      "text": "Another big performance from Taine Basham with ball-in-hand.\n15 carries, 46 metres, 1 try.\nAdding in 10 tackles in 52 minutes as well, definitely making a case to Steve Tandy for a test return.",
      "author": "Cardiff Rugby Life",
      "handle": "cardiffrugbylife.bsky.social",
