      "id": "bsky:at://did:plc:3pzepjafmdqgrchkqdypeuea/app.bsky.feed.post/3mx6qyhs6lq2v",
      "text": "Thom Evans has revealed the lasting impact of the injury that ended his rugby career, saying he lost his identity after hanging up his boots\n🔗 shorturl.at/dGgrP",
      "author": "Scotland Rugby News",
      "handle": "scotlandrugbynews.bsky.social",
