      "source": "UC-S6cXyil4qbIPfb2hrcH4w"
    },
    {
      "type": "bluesky",
      "id": "bsky:at://did:plc:ouvin3vruox2v2t674dym2c5/app.bsky.feed.post/3mx5bax3pic2a",
      "text": "Great to see Teddy Williams deservedly on the scoresheet and a good finish too, but particularly want to highlight that Alex Mann assist.\nSo late and so well disguised, his link play is consistently top class.",
      "author": "Cardiff Rugby Life",
      "handle": "cardiffrugbylife.bsky.social",
