      "id": "bsky:at://did:plc:7azxdiemtvd7otuvlaeddz7p/app.bsky.feed.post/3mx2fi4tkbd2r",
      "text": "R3️⃣ away to @GlasgowWarriors 🏴󠁧󠁢󠁳󠁣󠁴󠁿\n#OneConnacht",
