    {
      "type": "youtube",
      "id": "yt:ZfZNsixX2kc",
      "title": "Charlie O’Shea Post-Match Bulls 🎙️",
      "author": "Munster Rugby",
      "avatar": null,
      "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZfZNsixX2kc",
      "publishedAt": "2026-10-04T11:45:12.000Z",
      "thumbnail": "https://i3.ytimg.com/vi/ZfZNsixX2kc/hqdefault.jpg",
      "source": "UC7991AZNku42o3Y36kUZOJA"
    },
    {
      "type": "bluesky",
      "id": "bsky:at://did:plc:ouvin3vruox2v2t674dym2c5/app.bsky.feed.post/3mx2aui5f4s2b",
      "text": "Just to counter some bizarre comments.\nThe 7,231 at CAP on Friday was Cardiff’s 3rd best home crowd for a Zebre game.\nThe top two came in Zebre’s first seasons of 12/13 and 13/14 before it was obvious they are not competitive.\nCrowds at CAP are on the up and up.",
      "author": "Cardiff Rugby Life",
      "handle": "cardiffrugbylife.bsky.social",
      "avatar": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:ouvin3vruox2v2t674dym2c5/bafkreifwhig3c235gkfloyju2rzwylbbjo3sp6xo57fhnk2ib7ywn7i37i",
      "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/cardiffrugbylife.bsky.social/post/3mx2aui5f4s2b",
      "publishedAt": "2026-10-04T11:02:51.303Z",
      "thumbnail": null,
      "source": "cardiffrugbylife.bsky.social"
    },
    {
      "type": "youtube",
      "id": "yt:UZE1Ayns-3s",
      "title": "Inside Matchday | URC Round Two | Stormers",
      "author": "Edinburgh Rugby",
      "avatar": null,
      "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UZE1Ayns-3s",
      "publishedAt": "2026-10-04T10:00:25.000Z",
      "thumbnail": "https://i2.ytimg.com/vi/UZE1Ayns-3s/hqdefault.jpg",
      "source": "UC5QfHoca5UPU3IU8XRw6FWg"
    },
    {
      "type": "bluesky",
      "id": "bsky:at://did:plc:bgeqymeltxrtny34aikxe4vy/app.bsky.feed.post/3mx25edoz732a",
      "text": "Just 6️⃣ days until we're finally back at Laya Arena! 🙌\n🎟️ Only a few tickets left for the homecoming game against Cardiff this Saturday: https://bit.ly/3UsT8jJ",
      "author": "Leinster Rugby",
      "handle": "leinsterrugby.bsky.social",
      "avatar": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:bgeqymeltxrtny34aikxe4vy/bafkreidewh6iscgzmp56acshzhwoixyjoxxld6vj6bi76zvuyirnaqf66y",
      "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/leinsterrugby.bsky.social/post/3mx25edoz732a",
      "publishedAt": "2026-10-04T10:00:08.423Z",
      "thumbnail": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_thumbnail/plain/did:plc:bgeqymeltxrtny34aikxe4vy/bafkreieia5rqucoizv5lxywwohp5mkjan3ogrh76x2wojxfgetpiz472wu",
      "source": "leinsterrugby.bsky.social"
    },
    {
      "type": "bluesky",
      "id": "bsky:at://did:plc:ffaez7heoltx2hhteuxtgxir/app.bsky.feed.post/3mwzygnmjbc2b",
      "text": "On Sunday mornings we share our notes from our feature match on Substack, including real-time screengrabs from our WhatsApp group throughout > jeffpagano.substack.com/p/sharks-v-l...",
      "author": "Harpin' On Rugby",
      "handle": "harpinonrugby.bsky.social",
      "avatar": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:ffaez7heoltx2hhteuxtgxir/bafkreiehjzabtopas56abxv6eloubkkbqofmpztzciypn7d42ne3zbqjae",
      "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/harpinonrugby.bsky.social/post/3mwzygnmjbc2b",
      "publishedAt": "2026-10-04T08:31:57.342Z",
      "thumbnail": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_thumbnail/plain/did:plc:ffaez7heoltx2hhteuxtgxir/bafkreifzpg4mayqknnuoplfgt64wqthe3thrwcd4htear6yep3sotqudhm",
      "source": "harpinonrugby.bsky.social"
    },
    {
      "type": "bluesky",
      "id": "bsky:at://did:plc:ouvin3vruox2v2t674dym2c5/app.bsky.feed.post/3mwzv7cqvq22s",
      "text": "Cardiff have found a balance for the six fly-halves across the first team and Academy squad this season, but there are big decisions on the horizon that impact the future of the position and the reputation of the club.\ncardiffrugbylife.wales/2026/10/04/d...",
      "author": "Cardiff Rugby Life",
      "handle": "cardiffrugbylife.bsky.social",
      "avatar": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:ouvin3vruox2v2t674dym2c5/bafkreifwhig3c235gkfloyju2rzwylbbjo3sp6xo57fhnk2ib7ywn7i37i",
      "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/cardiffrugbylife.bsky.social/post/3mwzv7cqvq22s",
      "publishedAt": "2026-10-04T07:34:09.846Z",
      "thumbnail": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_thumbnail/plain/did:plc:ouvin3vruox2v2t674dym2c5/bafkreiei2o7ulsd5ju4kks2ugoezbxuug5ovqcaemuws27mm6wuhwj3qse",
      "source": "cardiffrugbylife.bsky.social"
    },
    {
      "type": "bluesky",
      "id": "bsky:at://did:plc:ffaez7heoltx2hhteuxtgxir/app.bsky.feed.post/3mwyiydwoyc2w",
      "text": "Second week in a row we pulled a late try out of the bag.  In the end it wasn't the scrums that did for us, could have won that with more accuracy in 22 but again plenty to be happy with, esp Sam's shift.  Thought Sharks might have gotten 2nd half card but still deserved win.  #SHAvLEI",
      "author": "Harpin' On Rugby",
      "handle": "harpinonrugby.bsky.social",
      "avatar": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:ffaez7heoltx2hhteuxtgxir/bafkreiehjzabtopas56abxv6eloubkkbqofmpztzciypn7d42ne3zbqjae",
      "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/harpinonrugby.bsky.social/post/3mwyiydwoyc2w",
      "publishedAt": "2026-10-03T18:22:51.564Z",
      "thumbnail": null,
      "source": "harpinonrugby.bsky.social"
    },
    {
      "type": "bluesky",
      "id": "bsky:at://did:plc:wizadpqsar4meknsnx7s3rms/app.bsky.feed.post/3mwyilu3av2un",
      "text": "Good BP win for the Sharks against Leinster. Champs came back in the third quarter, but the returning Boks made a big impact at the death.\nLeinster head back to Ireland with 3 log points from 2 matches.",
      "author": "Jon Cardinelli",
      "handle": "joncardinelli.bsky.social",
      "avatar": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:wizadpqsar4meknsnx7s3rms/bafkreicmmiirqk2ft7xymnjwhs66pxlm4ttg4u2v7vqg26qpvuchxm5nri",
      "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/joncardinelli.bsky.social/post/3mwyilu3av2un",
      "publishedAt": "2026-10-03T18:15:52.284Z",
      "thumbnail": null,
      "source": "joncardinelli.bsky.social"
    },
    {
      "type": "bluesky",
      "id": "bsky:at://did:plc:mqdmx5o74xrnl4jwd7eroh35/app.bsky.feed.post/3mwyiadnr7k2t",
      "text": "Not convinced \"driven backwards by Jamie Dobie\" is a phrase you'd ever want to hear used about yourself",
      "author": "Scottish Rugby Podcast",
      "handle": "scotrugbypod.bsky.social",
      "avatar": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:mqdmx5o74xrnl4jwd7eroh35/bafkreifbllydjgwnuwniseg4xdzqgul2n6mvpnva2ybemkowieg7tp4h7u",
      "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/scotrugbypod.bsky.social/post/3mwyiadnr7k2t",
      "publishedAt": "2026-10-03T18:09:25.966Z",
      "thumbnail": null,
      "source": "scotrugbypod.bsky.social"
