    {
      "type": "bluesky",
      "id": "bsky:at://did:plc:wizadpqsar4meknsnx7s3rms/app.bsky.feed.post/3mwv775qsc2xl",
      "text": "Have wanted to write this piece for awhile about the Boks' record and how some critics and fans have started to lose perspective.\nDespite all they've achieved, Boks always seems to be 1 loss away from being denounced as a boring, old or overrated team.\nwww.dailymaverick.co.za/article/2026...",
